join Sipho (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Sipho (Aggravated)
Sipho: You helped with the gutters. So you know I'm not making this up.
- Making what up?
	Hope: Making what up?
	Sipho: I want to build a proper system at the schoolhouse. Tank on a stand, real gutters, a first-flush diverter.
	Sipho: Charity says NGOs fund things that are already proven. So it has to be proven first, on paper, before anyone sends anything.
	Sipho: I can do the numbers. That part's done, near enough.
	- Then what do you need?
		Hope: Then what do you need?
		Sipho: Someone to help make them look like something an office in Polokwane will read. That isn't the same skill.
		Sipho: It isn't a smaller one either. I know that.
		set {GameState.quest_sipho_schoolhouse_case} = "active"
		[signal arg="objective:Help Sipho document the schoolhouse's current shortfall and frame the NGO ask with Charity"]
	- Show me the notebook
		Hope: Show me the notebook.
		Sipho: The roof measurements are at the back. Don't round anything up — if the number's soft they'll know.
		set {GameState.quest_sipho_schoolhouse_case} = "active"
		[signal arg="objective:Help Sipho document the schoolhouse's current shortfall and frame the NGO ask with Charity"]
[signal arg="hearts:sipho:1"]
